stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Waiting: coordinator up
  Waiting --> Ready: active + ≥ min_passive parties registered
  Ready --> Validating: START requested
  Validating --> Ready: config / manifest mismatch (refused)
  Validating --> Aligning: START delivered by heartbeat
  Aligning --> Training: aligned order agreed
  Training --> EpochBarrier: last batch of epoch committed
  EpochBarrier --> Training: all parties reached barrier
  EpochBarrier --> Testing: final epoch
  Training --> Stopped: STOP / party lost / timeout
  EpochBarrier --> Stopped: barrier_timeout_s
  Testing --> Completed
  Stopped --> Aligning: resume_from (last complete epoch checkpoint)
  Completed --> [*]
